Z||000004||Hartz||08-12-99||04:30 AM||||Many years ago there was an article in one of the Fiero club newsletters about someone installing a Dodge Daytona Turbo Z hood vent in the back of a Fiero.  It's flat, and a nice fit in that area between the reinforcements (underside of decklid) and just behind the bulge on the '85+'s.<p>Might be a good alternative if you didn't want anything too obvious.<p>-Hartz
